subject_definitions:
<Subject 1> — 钱经理: a 45-year-old male property manager. Slightly overweight, slicked-back oily hair, round face, an ingratiating smile that flips into a scowl, white shirt buttoned to the closed collar under a dark grey buttoned waistcoat, dark grey trousers, black leather shoes. His voice is loud, nasal and bullying, standard Mandarin. It is the person shown in <Picture 1>.
<Subject 2> — 苏小满: a 25-year-old female cleaner. Preserve her exact face, small lean build, centre-parted black hair in a low practical ponytail, plain dark-navy button-up work shirt buttoned to the closed collar with small plain buttons down the front, a worn grey apron over dark navy trousers, black cloth shoes. Her voice is low, steady and slightly hoarse, standard Mandarin. It is the person shown in <Picture 2>.
<Subject 3> — 小唐: a 22-year-old female cleaning-team colleague. Thin, pale, narrow shoulders, shifty sidelong eyes, hair tied back in a low ponytail, light-grey button-up work shirt with a pointed collar and matching light-grey trousers, a light-grey apron tied round her waist, black cloth shoes. Her voice is small, thin and nervous. It is the person shown in <Picture 3>.
<Picture 4>: the office layout reference for 万山大厦 — this same single room is the set for the whole clip. Light-oak storage cabinets along the back-left wall with plain brown cardboard boxes stacked on top; a low wooden credenza under the back window with a printer, files and two potted green plants; an L-shaped wooden office desk with a black monitor, keyboard and document tray in the middle of the room, a black swivel chair pushed in; a grey fabric sofa with wooden armrests and a low wooden coffee table under the long window on the right; an open doorway with a grey metal frame on the left. Pale grey polished tile floor, white acoustic ceiling with recessed light panels.

summary:
[reference generation] Interior of a bright property office at midday. The manager slams his palm down and names an expensive accusation; the cleaner stands her ground and says nothing; the colleague by the sofa does not move.

retention_analysis:
<Subject 1> — 钱经理: fully_preserved - slicked-back oily hair, round face, dark grey buttoned waistcoat over a white shirt
<Subject 2> — 苏小满: fully_preserved - centre-parted black hair in a low practical ponytail, dark navy work shirt, worn grey apron
<Subject 3> — 小唐: fully_preserved - hair in a low ponytail, light-grey work shirt, light-grey apron
<Picture 4>: fully_preserved - light-oak cabinets, L-shaped desk, grey sofa on the right, doorway on the left

detailed_description:
HORIZONTAL 4:3 landscape framing, high-key commercial cinematography, soft broad daylight, luminous pale walls, light reflective floor, every surface clearly readable. Keep the film texture, natural lighting, every face, every costume and the realistic motion consistent throughout. People stay standing, framed from the knees up. The camera is locked off for the whole clip: the framing never changes and the size of everything in frame stays the same from the first frame to the last. All movement comes from the people inside the fixed frame. All three of them stay visible in the same three places in every single frame from the first frame to the last, and the open doorway at frame left shows only the corridor wall beyond it.
Exposure: the long right-hand window is the key light and soft bounced daylight fills the room; skin tones are bright and even, shadows sit in the light mid-tones, the whites stay white, and the picture carries an even high-key brightness from edge to edge. Every shirt and waistcoat is buttoned right up to the closed collar, so each chest shows one continuous unbroken run of plain fabric with its own small plain buttons down the front. Apron bibs are plain unmarked fabric.
Speaker labels for this shot only: (S1) 钱经理, (S2) 苏小满, (S3) 小唐. Anyone not named here stays completely silent with a closed mouth.
The whole clip takes place in the one office shown in <Picture 4>, and the three of them hold these same standing places from the first frame to the last: 钱经理 (S1) behind the L-shaped desk in the middle of the room, his body square to the desk and his head turned to the open doorway at frame left, shouting into that empty doorway and NOT at either woman; 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of that desk in right profile facing right towards him, both feet flat on the tile; 小唐 (S3) on the right side of the room beside the grey sofa in left profile, facing left towards the desk.

[Shot 1] Static Shot, medium-wide three-shot across the desk: 钱经理 (S1) takes one quick step forward behind the desk and slams his palm flat on the wood, then turns his head to the open doorway at frame left to address the empty doorway at frame left; 苏小满 (S2) and 小唐 (S3) both keep their mouths closed; 苏小满 (S2) is at the near left corner of the desk in right profile with her feet planted and does not move; 小唐 (S3) stands beside the grey sofa at frame right, watching.

[Shot 2] At 00:01.250, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the exact same medium-wide three-shot framing of shot 1 with the same three people in the same places, 钱经理 (S1) behind the desk keeping his palm on the wood, his head still turned to the open doorway at frame left, his chin lifted towards that empty doorway, and he opens his mouth to shout at them in a loud bullying nasal Mandarin, 钱经理 (S1) speaks with his mouth opening wide as he shouts: [Chinese] 三楼包厢。 苏小满 (S2) and 小唐 (S3) keep their mouths closed and still.

[Shot 3] At 00:02.500, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the exact same medium-wide three-shot framing of shot 1 with the same three people in the same places, 钱经理 (S1) behind the desk as a band of daylight crosses his chest and he leans over the desk, his face still turned to the open doorway at frame left and not towards either woman, still shouting in the same loud nasal Mandarin into that empty doorway, 钱经理 (S1) speaks, his jaw and lips moving clearly as he shouts into the empty doorway:  [Chinese] 贵客丢了一只金耳钉。 苏小满 (S2) and 小唐 (S3) keep their mouths closed and still.

[Shot 4] At 00:03.750, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the exact same medium-wide three-shot framing of shot 1 with the same three people in the same places, 苏小满 (S2) in right profile in the near foreground with her mouth closed, 钱经理 (S1) across the wood from her with his hand still flat and his head still turned to the open doorway at frame left, calling the price out into that empty doorway, 钱经理 (S1) speaks with his mouth moving clearly as he calls the price out to the doorway: [Chinese] 三万八。 苏小满 (S2) and 小唐 (S3) keep their mouths closed and still.

[Shot 5] At 00:05.000, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the exact same medium-wide three-shot framing of shot 1 with the same three people in the same places, 小唐 (S3) beside the grey sofa lowering her eyes, her fingers closing on the sofa's wooden arm and her jaw setting tight; she stays exactly where she stands.

[Shot 6] At 00:06.500, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the exact same medium-wide three-shot framing of shot 1 with the same three people in the same places, the folder lying flat at the middle of the desk, 钱经理 (S1) bearing down on it from behind the desk, 苏小满 (S2) still in profile at the near left corner of the desk, 小唐 (S3) still beside the sofa at frame right.

From [Shot 5] onward every mouth in frame is closed, the line is finished, and the office falls into room tone.

No slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.

overall_soundscape: A clock ticking on the wall and the low hum of the ceiling lights throughout; one sharp heel strike at 0.4s as 钱经理 steps forward; a flat palm slap on the desk top at 1.0s; room tone returns at 5.2s.

non_diegetic_music: A low sustained string drone enters at 0s, a single wood-block knock lands with the palm slap at 1.0s, and the track thins to one held note from 5.2s onward.
